          {
            "id": 2833917,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "Good afternoon. My name's missus Carter, and I run the before and after school extended hours child care service. I hope you've had a chance to have a good look around the school and talk to staff and pupils. I know that many of you are interested in using our child care service when your child joins the school, and perhaps you already know something about it, but for those that don't, I'll go through the main details now. We offer child care for children from the ages of four to 11, both before and after school.",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2833918,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Good afternoon.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 62.04,
                  "from": 61.0,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2833921,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "My name's missus Carter, and I run the before and after school extended hours child care service.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 68.68,
                  "from": 62.28,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2833939,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "I hope you've had a chance to have a good look around the school and talk to staff and pupils.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 74.605,
                  "from": 69.08501,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2833960,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "I know that many of you are interested in using our child care service when your child joins the school, and perhaps you already know something about it, but for those that don't, I'll go through the main details now.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 88.76,
                  "from": 75.08501,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2834001,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "We offer child care for children from the ages of four to 11, both before and after school.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 96.200005,
                  "from": 89.240005,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2834020,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "I know that many parents who work find this service invaluable. You can leave your child with us, safe in the knowledge that they will be extremely well cared for. We are ensured to provide care for up to 70 children, although we rarely have this many attending at any one session. I think we generally expect around 50 to 60 children for the afternoon sessions, and about half that number for the breakfast sessions. Although we currently do have 70 children registered with us, not all of these attend every day.",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2834021,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "I know that many parents who work find this service invaluable.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 101.255005,
                  "from": 96.935005,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2834033,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "You can leave your child with us, safe in the knowledge that they will be extremely well cared for.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 107.815,
                  "from": 101.735,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2834053,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "We are ensured to provide care for up to 70 children, although we rarely have this many attending at any one session.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 116.74,
                  "from": 108.69501,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2834076,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "I think we generally expect around 50 to 60 children for the afternoon sessions, and about half that number for the breakfast sessions.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 126.66,
                  "from": 117.54,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2834100,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Although we currently do have 70 children registered with us, not all of these attend every day.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 134.52501,
                  "from": 127.885,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2834118,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "It's ten years since we began offering an extended hours service, and we've come a long way during that time. When we first opened, we only had about 20 children attending regularly. We try to keep our costs as low as we can, and we think we provide very good value for money. For the afternoon sessions, which run from 03:30 until 6PM, it's £7.20. But if you prefer, you can pay for one hour only, which costs £3.50, or two hours, which costs £5.7 The cost of the childcare includes food and snacks.",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2834119,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "It's ten years since we began offering an extended hours service, and we've come a long way during that time.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 141.725,
                  "from": 135.245,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2834140,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "When we first opened, we only had about 20 children attending regularly.",
